       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CLAYSCAPE-PROOFS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CLAYSCAPE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-PASTE-EXTRUSION-CONTINUITY PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NON-PLANAR-SLICING-INVAR   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THERMAL-SHRINKAGE-VERLET   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GLAZE-SPECTRAL-SCATTER-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLAYSCAPE-FABRICATION-SEAL PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CLAY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CLAY-PROVEN            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CLAY-CODE            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EXTRUSION-AND-SLICING.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SHRINKAGE-AND-GLAZE.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EXTRUSION-AND-SLICING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PASTE-EXTRUSION-CONTINUITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NON-PLANAR-SLICING-INVAR.
       2000-EVALUATE-SHRINKAGE-AND-GLAZE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-THERMAL-SHRINKAGE-VERLET.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GLAZE-SPECTRAL-SCATTER-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CLAY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-PASTE-EXTRUSION-CONTINUITY = 1 AND
              WS-NON-PLANAR-SLICING-INVAR = 1 AND
              WS-THERMAL-SHRINKAGE-VERLET = 1 AND
              WS-GLAZE-SPECTRAL-SCATTER-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-CLAYSCAPE-FABRICATION-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CLAY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CLAY-CODE.
